{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_dusk_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_dusk_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"旦夕","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_dusk_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"88035e80174051f82a1f5d729922bd677f1dbb9b979ee7d7cdbb8854987e4c1d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g03_yandowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，您別走啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"已經被你騙了，我不走還等什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"阮先生雖然不是什麼千古大家，但他最為人稱讚的，便是絲毫不差的精妙骨法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"這幅畫學阮先生的氣勢，倒是學到了三四分，可墨線歪斜，肉不附骨，骨不連筋，也好意思說是真跡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"您留步，留步呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我是怕您不愛聽，這才沒把不堪的真相和盤托出......這確實是他的真跡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不堪的真相？他就住在這城裡，好歹是你同鄉，你就這麼誣衊他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再說，就算再怎麼不堪，他也畫不出這麼糟的東西來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"他眼睛壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"這事我絕不撒謊！阮先生眼睛盲了，才有了我手裡這幅畫呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"阮先生年輕時就有眼病，這事我聽說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"可他心高氣傲，就算眼睛盲了，又怎麼會讓這種東西流傳於世，敗壞他自己的名聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"您聽我說呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"阮先生的眼疾近年越來越重，到了後來，只要紙上的字略小一點，就算貼在眼前也看不清。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"偏偏阮先生又心高氣傲，死不承認自己看不見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"有奸人認准了他這一點，先是跟他虛與委蛇，騙取信任之後，把精心定好的合同放在他面前，哄他簽下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"名字一簽，阮先生不但背上巨債，連眼疾也瞞不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，他病了幾個月，據說徹底盲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......人心竟刻毒至此？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"誰說不是呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"本來嘛，要是事情到此為止，也只是阮先生誤中奸計，我也不敢瞎說什麼“不堪”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"可他在那之後一蹶不振，為了還債，已經不擇手段了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"不擇手段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"他盲後畫技一落千丈，不能入行家的眼，竟然開始以“盲人作畫”為噱頭，招徠附近的富人看他作畫，換取他們的打賞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"實不相瞞，現在他作一幅畫，畫本身賣不了幾個錢，或許還沒那些大人物的賞錢多。我手裡這幅畫，也是從那些人手中收購來的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌櫃","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富翁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阮老真是奇人，小像和我這孫兒竟然有七八分相似！還有這頭上的淡墨，也和孫兒頭頂的胎記大差不差！先生果真是盲的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......盲的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富翁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"倒也沒錯，假如不盲，又怎麼會連合約上的大字都看不見呢，哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"富翁","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是給先生的潤筆，請先生笑納。我先告辭了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"那掌櫃居然沒說錯，阮先生真的如此不堪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"一介說書人而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......說書人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道阮先生心高氣傲，當年為了追求逼真，對著景物枯坐三日，卻不知道，他如今竟然甘心當起籠中的珍禽異獸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是同道中人特地來我這裡棒喝，好意我心領了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是人各有志，我現在雙眼盲了，實在無力再分辨什麼假假真真，不過是苟延殘喘，不至於倒斃路旁罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老阮，老阮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是前天上午來找你作畫的人，難道你這麼快就忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......褚先生吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你畫的這個《花羽圖》究竟是什麼東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羽獸的腳爪好像被掰折成了幾截，花瓣的上色也是一團污濁，不知道的還以為你把調色碟打翻在上面了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我還把你畫的這東西拿去給懂行的看，問他們這是什麼技法，墨骨如何，你猜他們說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們說，你的“墨骨”早就成了“媚骨”，你畫的東西也跟著東倒西歪，早就一文不值了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媚骨？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......褚先生，我們一開始說好了的，潤筆您看著給，無論多少都行，但事後您不能反悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早知道你這樣，別說潤筆，你付我錢我都不要你的畫！今天你要是不還錢，我就去報官，說你以次充好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"褚先生，既然你們事先已經約好，官府是不會管這事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這和你有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要是官府不管，我還有別的手段，這老東西無論如何都得把錢給我吐出來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是上了“別的手段”，那才要勞煩官府費心呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，算我吃了個悶虧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"來人舉起手中的畫，作勢欲撕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要幹什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那人手中發力，三兩下把畫撕了個粉碎。\n他向上一拋，碎紙如同雪片般紛紛落下，撒了阮先生一身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投機商","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姓阮的，就你這德行，連乞丐都不如！他們說得沒錯，你就是一身媚骨！下賤！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......媚骨？下賤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這話，我可沒法駁他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"“不”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你口口聲聲說自己目盲，可你真的全盲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"用噱頭換錢已經算是不堪了，偏偏你這噱頭又只有七八成真，你還好意思說這個“不”字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這是什麼意思？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"嬰兒頭上的胎記就不用說了。還有，剛剛那姓褚的要撕你的畫，紙還沒破，你已經叫出了聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我沒猜錯，你視力確實沒了一大半，紙上的字就不用說了，連顏色明暗可能都分不清，所以畫技才會一落千丈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"但要說你全盲，那就是糊弄人的鬼話了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生......明察。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"連最後這個謊都被人看穿，我還有什麼顏面苟活於世？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如找個清淨地方......一了百了，也算乾淨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"乾淨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你這一死，阮先生從今往後，永遠都是一身媚骨的下賤之人，談何乾淨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我又該如何？又能如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"別說你並未全盲，就算真盲了，就不能畫了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就......不能畫了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能畫......也許能畫......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——恕我愚鈍，這盲眼作畫的法子，還請先生詳細賜教！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我所聞非你所聞，我所觸非你所觸，我所嘗非你所嘗，我怎麼教你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所聞......所觸......所嘗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天已經乏了，你好自為之吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g03_yandowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必是我聽錯了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你我之間應該沒什麼可說的了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎敢！先生大恩，我時刻銘記在心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我對你有什麼恩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生傳授我聞、觸、嘗的畫法，我才能在這數月之中踏踏實實作畫一幅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實不相瞞，我正打算請同好品評新作，沒想到在這裡遇上了先生。現在想來，先生才是該第一個品評我這畫的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒用不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我更想知道，你聽見了什麼，觸碰了什麼，又嘗到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那天先生走後，我細細尋思，富翁嘲笑我，商人辱駡我，先生點撥我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我雖然看不清，可要將聽到的形貌神態落在紙上，縱然不太容易，卻終究有跡可循。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"那在你聽來，我要是在你畫中，該是什麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生該是個清癯瘦高、遺世獨立的中年男子，淡淡髭鬚，兩眼炯炯有神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"這也不算什麼。你視力尚存，要看我身材輪廓，本來也不難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，要是閉上雙眼仔細聽，先生偶爾又像個面冷心熱的女子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信口胡說，先生莫怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"不怪，不怪，反而怪有趣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"那觸呢？嘗呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"觸法最簡單不過。我想畫什麼，就在手中把玩，細細摩挲感受一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實在龐大的東西，就乾脆將畫桌搬到旁邊，邊摸邊想邊畫，也是有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於嘗......說來好笑，我把墨塊和顏料的味道嘗了個遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"僅知道單一顏料的味道尚且不夠，我依以前作畫時的經驗調和顏料，請人對比，顏色正好相應時，就取幾滴放進嘴裡，把味道銘記在心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你......不怕中毒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能夠重拾畫筆，已經是我天大的福氣。一點顏料的毒，沒什麼可怕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，知道你這樣發憤，這畫必定差不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"不打擾你了，你快去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道先生......一直在此處等我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我不過是在這街上散心，遠遠看見你回來，面色不佳，就來打個照面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"出什麼事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這幅畫被同道指出許多不足之處......僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"僅此而已？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你眼盲之後認認真真畫的第一幅畫，就算有不足之處也是天經地義，怎麼一下子這麼萎靡不振？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小事，都是......小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生不必再替我掛懷，我......先回去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這話說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鞭辟入裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下品之人，筆下當然是下品之作，哈哈，哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這畫究竟如何是下品，究竟下品在哪，要我這個半盲花多少年歲看出來啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了吧。這身媚骨左右是甩不脫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"累了，累了。曲終人散，早該是時候了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是對不住那位先生......可我也無計可施了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"雙眼渾濁的畫家仰頭看向頭頂的房梁。\n桌旁是他數月前下定決心時購置的絹帛數匹。\n畫成之後，出發之前，他想像過種種場景，溫暖的，冰冷的，令人汗顏的。\n他唯獨沒想過，那些人看了看他的畫，又看了看他，沉默良久，然後不知是誰，不冷不熱地說了一句“下品”。\n其他人似乎覺得有些過火，開始為這二字找補。然而，找補到最後，沒有一個人對這兩個字提出異議。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"現在看來，這些絹帛上已經什麼都不必畫了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"畫家站起身，把一匹絹帛拋過房梁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"阮先生，我還以為你多有出息，到頭來，怎麼還在尋死啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生現在登門，又是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"一幅畫好與不好，難道不該是作畫者本人最先評判嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道先生是鼓勵我，可現如今，這話除了取笑，我聽不出別的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"取笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"阮先生，我只問你一句話，你到底想不想看看，你自己畫的這幅畫究竟是什麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經累了，先生請回吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我怎能不想？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好辦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你聽我的，今晚酉時一過，明日辰時之前，你必定能心明眼亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生好意，我感激不盡。可先生這緩兵之計能救得了我一時，救不了我一世。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酉時一到，我眼前還是一片虛影，那時先生又該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這雙眼是胎裡帶來的毛病，藥石針灸試了個遍，全都不起作用。先生兩句話就能讓人復明，世間哪有這麼好的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我是什麼名醫聖手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴你吧，要是你真想要這一夜清明，明日辰時一到，你這雙眼就會徹底失去視力，不是一片虛影，而是一片漆黑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......此話......當真？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"真真假假，只有你自己知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你願意，就即刻上床入睡，到酉時你自然會醒。一夜光明過後，明日辰時，你就徹底與光亮無緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你不願，只要不睡即可。枯坐家中也好，出門散心也好，反正你這雙眼睛是不可能好的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這事突如其來，先生能否再詳細講講......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼可講的。你愛睡就睡，愛醒就醒，本來也沒人管得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己想想吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"畫家望向房梁上飄飄蕩蕩的那一匹白絹，又回頭看了看桌上的畫卷，並未有更多言語。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他只是脫了鞋子，在榻上和衣而臥，很快就睡著了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"復明之後，看到自己的畫，你就會明白，卑下的早已不是你，而是那群人心中的成見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"然後......好好看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"看看書，看看畫，看看這夜裡的景色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是這麼小的一方城市，要用短短的一夕光陰盡收眼底，也未免太倉促了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"一夕光陰，或許連夢，都做不完一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"對你，對我，都實在太倉促了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"時間不早了，我一刻也不想虛擲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"我一刻也不想虛擲，可時間......畢竟是不早了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"酉時，沒錯，現在是酉時沒錯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"畫家從榻上彈了起來，衝到桌前，展開自己那幅被譏嘲為下品的畫卷，心急如焚地觀覽起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡線條歪斜，這裡神態不正，這裡用色有些豔俗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這些都是可以光明正大指出來的東西，他們憑什麼說這幅畫是“下品”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這畫和我二十幾歲嶄露頭角時的作品差不多同一水準，怎麼會是下品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找他們理論——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只有這一夜了......我只有這一夜了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"narration","text":"夕陽西斜，室內晦暗不明，可在畫家眼中，每一盞燈都如同太陽般明亮，每一盞燈都幾乎晃得他睜不開眼。\n他被這輝煌的金光刺得流下淚來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他多想再借這光看看自己的畫，看看自己珍藏的名作，看看畫外的山河錦繡，販夫走卒。\n但他只有這一夜了。\n他從房梁上拽下那匹絹帛，扯出一截裱在板上，手忙腳亂地洗筆、研墨、調製顏料。\n他提起細筆，還未思考要畫什麼，慣於勾線的手就不由自主地動了起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"就如同有暗夜在身後窮追不捨，人就會不由自主想逃一樣。\n就如同有紅日在身前緩緩落下，人就會不由自主想追一樣。\n隨著線條編織出人像，他突然想起很久以前聽過的荒誕不經的故事。\n夜幕降臨，一個人為了追逐落日，不停地奔跑。\n他跑到汗如雨下，跑到喝乾了溪流，喝乾了湖泊，喝乾了大河。\n但他還是在不停地奔跑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"因為他只有這一夜了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"畫家感到口乾舌燥，順手抓起手邊的筆洗。\n裡面的水混著從筆上洗下的墨，早已是一團混沌。\n他對著黑色的水凝視片刻，將其一飲而盡，然後什麼也不再想。\n他只有這一夜了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"東方既白。\n如果畫家有心，他一定能注意到，說書人的身影一直藏在陰影中，怔怔地注視著他，連大氣都不敢出，整整看了一夜。\n但他早已無心顧及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......畫完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我畫了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"narration","text":"三礬九染過的絹上，畫中的阮先生斜倚桌邊，遙望窗外。\n那裡有什麼？\n看著畫中阮先生的眼睛，畫外的阮先生知道，那裡有他從出生到此刻全部的光明。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"他小心翼翼地拿起畫好的畫，憑藉著對屋中陳設的熟悉，邁開一步——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心撞翻東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我去幫你把畫裱好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g01_yanstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我那朋友就住這裡，先生送我到這就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定他可靠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果連他也不可靠......我在這城中，也就沒有可以信賴的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"阮先生，你這一作已經可說是形神兼備，登峰造極，真的還要他人首肯，你才心滿意足嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕笑聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阮先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我終究，還是扯不脫這一身媚骨啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）事到如今......媚骨？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阮先生，你怎麼回事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快來人，有人吐血暈倒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿七，快去醫館找個大夫來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你對他做什麼了？他怎麼會這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我真的沒做什麼，我只是說了幾句話而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他的人品不堪，他的畫就算再像真的，也談不上高明，更何況還是自畫像，與自吹自擂沒什麼區別......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛請本城畫壇德高望重的張先生過來，他走之前也悄悄對我這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"張先生還知道悄悄，你就直接對他說了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不是！這話我只是心裡想想，怎麼可能直接對他說！我只是說，他這幅畫是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男聲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下中之......上上者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"......下中之上上者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，好一個下中之上上者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"說書人","speakerId":"avg_npc_138","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城，不待也罷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我筆下怎會有如此陰鷙之物？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無名的墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我看你不是陰鷙，只是比阿咬他們想得多些，睡不好覺，這才一副嚇人的模樣吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"無名的墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就叫你“妒”好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"新得了名字的墨魎搖搖身軀，轉身往後走去。\n原本在那裡扎堆的阿咬和小躁們彷彿十分畏懼似的，一溜煙地散了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"腳步聲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）這老傢伙，腳程未免太快了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我不過是在自己的畫裡再添兩筆，這也要管嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，你不是那老傢伙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......阮先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十餘年過去，你還活著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"托先生的福，姑且算是活著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你且請坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是免了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山石冰冷，寒氣森森，我這一把老骨頭，經不起折騰嘍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山石？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）對了，他已經全盲，當然看不到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）那他......到底是怎麼進入我畫中的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道先生說了什麼要緊事，我聽漏了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是好奇，這二十多年，你究竟是怎麼過來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說來也挺可笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那日我在醫館醒來之後，醫生說，我這一條命幾乎去了半條，以後務必靜養神思，絕不可再動肝火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己也覺得心灰意冷，棄了名號，放下畫筆，將家產盡數變賣，還了那筆錢，離了城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就連那幅嘔心瀝血的畫，我都以低價出給了別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我心裡想，倒在哪裡，哪裡就是我的埋骨之所了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這麼說來，我當年倒不該多管閒事，還是放著你不管對你好些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生不必心生歉意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼時候向你道歉了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生想要掩飾，可當年傳授我的聽聞之法，我這些年從來沒生疏過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，盤纏很快用光，可我還沒到入土的時候，說不得，只好又拿起畫筆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是這次不再刻意找什麼達官貴人，只要帶著紙筆坐在街頭，自然有人願意來找你寫生畫像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依舊是“盲人作畫”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，這次作畫的是真盲人，只不過來求畫的未必看得出罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不告訴他們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畫出的東西能得意就是了，畫家盲不盲，又有什麼關係呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"常有人覺得我畫得好，想讓我給自家庭院之類的死物也畫一幅，那時我就只能將眼盲的事和盤托出，嚇他們一下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我聽來，你依舊因他們的稱讚而沾沾自喜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生問了我這麼多問題，以剛剛這一問最佳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"山風吹過，室內的陳設簌簌作響。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生記得“媚骨”二字嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一直沒忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當年百般懇求別人的承認，彷彿沒了他們點頭自己就活不下去，媚人之心浸到了骨子裡，這“媚骨”二字，一語中的，讓我寢食難安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可後來，我離開了家，離了那片狹窄的天地，才發現，何止是我自己啊，世人要嘛媚人，要嘛為人所媚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正能對一切都不假辭色的人，也許有，我不認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人生一世，幼少時對雙親言聽計從，青年時對愛人曲意逢迎，壯年時難免取悅流俗，到老了，說不定還要反過來對自己的兒女低聲下氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千媚萬媚，不過是為了牽掛之人的承認，而牽掛之人的承認，又不過是為了自己心安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我如今無牽無掛，被人誇獎，我也沾沾自喜，被人斥駡，我也汗顏無地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可一覺過後，我心自安，他人言語，不過是過眼雲煙而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，這一身媚骨，媚的不過是我自己這顆心罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽君此言，當浮一大白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這種時候，我才會可惜我那位姐姐不在身邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽了你的警語，我也沒什麼可送你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶你出去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不忙，不忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，明明是先生有恩於我，我怎麼好意思還受先生的饋贈呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生身邊，似乎有些響動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像是風吹畫卷，又像活物動靜，又有些像先生心聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生當年的大恩，我無論如何也報不完。乾脆讓我給此物畫像一幅，送給先生，先生覺得怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......請。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"畫家寥寥數筆，既非工筆，又非寫意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這畫如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像，像極了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那就好，那就好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"來客","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不勞煩先生遠送，我這就啟程了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有幾個人能像他這樣在我的畫中來去自由？他......甚至什麼都看不見啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要世間還有這等人物，誰又願意睡，誰又願意醒呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本想這幾天找個好日子睡一覺的，現在看來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"桌上，剛剛被畫家揮毫潑墨的紙，重新變得一片潔白，而夕身邊的阿咬，不知何時變成了兩隻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬&阿咬？","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"（相互歪了歪頭）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩隻一模一樣的阿咬對視了一會，似乎是確認了對方的同類身份，肩並著肩，歡歡喜喜地走遠了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
